            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制并编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Duplicate a built-in theme to start from its palette, or import one as JSON. Long-press a theme for more.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内蔵テーマを複製してその配色から始めるか、JSON で読み込みます。テーマを長押しすると他の操作が表示されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制一个内置主题即可基于它的配色开始，也可以导入 JSON。长按主题可看到更多操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ECDSA-sk": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ECDSA-sk"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ECDSA-sk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ECDSA-sk keys live on hardware tokens such as a YubiKey. iOS cannot enumerate them directly yet; paste the public key line (sk-ecdsa-sha2-nistp256@openssh.com …) under Import.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ECDSA-sk キーは YubiKey などのハードウェアトークンに保存されます。iOS はまだ直接列挙できません。Import で公開鍵行（sk-ecdsa-sha2-nistp256@openssh.com …）を貼り付けてください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ECDSA-sk 密钥保存在 YubiKey 等硬件令牌上。iOS 暂不支持直接枚举；请在 Import 里粘贴它的公钥行（sk-ecdsa-sha2-nistp256@openssh.com …）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ED25519": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ED25519"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ED25519"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ED25519 recommended: 32-byte keys, fast signatures, no practical break to date.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ED25519 推奨：32 バイト鍵で署名が高速、現時点で実用的な攻撃は知られていません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推荐 ED25519：32 字节密钥，签名快，目前未被实战攻破。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "編集"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit %@": {
